WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:01.901 --> 00:00:03.734
♪♪

00:00:03.734 --> 00:00:05.667
-Now, let's get to the news.

00:00:05.667 --> 00:00:07.601
When asked by a reporter

00:00:07.601 --> 00:00:09.400
over the weekend
if he had a message

00:00:09.400 --> 00:00:11.801
for North Korean leader
Kim Jong-un,

00:00:11.801 --> 00:00:12.901
President Biden said,

00:00:12.901 --> 00:00:15.501
"Hello, period."

00:00:15.501 --> 00:00:16.901
[ Laughter ]

00:00:16.901 --> 00:00:20.300
Which sounds lame, but remember,
a hello followed by a period

00:00:20.300 --> 00:00:22.968
is the scariest text
you can receive.

00:00:22.968 --> 00:00:25.167
[ Laughter ]

00:00:25.167 --> 00:00:28.000
In her new memoir, former Trump
advisor Kellyanne Conway writes

00:00:28.000 --> 00:00:30.200
that her husband,
George Conway's, attacks

00:00:30.200 --> 00:00:33.934
against the administration were,
"Sneaky, almost sinister,"

00:00:33.934 --> 00:00:37.100
and it's honestly why she fell
in love with him all over again.

00:00:37.100 --> 00:00:38.400
[ Laughter ]

00:00:38.400 --> 00:00:40.534
Conway also writes that former
President Trump was,

00:00:40.534 --> 00:00:43.734
"A feminist who repeatedly
supported and promoted her."

00:00:43.734 --> 00:00:45.501
Said Trump, "Thanks, Maryanne."

00:00:45.501 --> 00:00:46.868
[ Laughter ]

00:00:46.868 --> 00:00:49.367
New York Mayor Eric Adams
is reportedly thinking

00:00:49.367 --> 00:00:51.267
about running for president
in 2024,

00:00:51.267 --> 00:00:53.334
if President Biden
does not seek reelection.

00:00:53.334 --> 00:00:55.467
Dude, have you seen what happens

00:00:55.467 --> 00:00:57.734
to New York City mayors
who run for president?

00:00:57.734 --> 00:01:00.868
It has about the same
success rate

00:01:00.868 --> 00:01:02.968
as asking out the barista.

00:01:02.968 --> 00:01:04.901
[ Laughter ]

00:01:04.901 --> 00:01:06.901
During a parade over the weekend
in New York,

00:01:06.901 --> 00:01:10.467
Rudy Giuliani called a heckler
a brainwashed ass[bleep]

00:01:10.467 --> 00:01:13.634
who is probably as "demented
as President Biden."

00:01:13.634 --> 00:01:16.133
Said an aide,
"That's a sky dancer."

00:01:16.133 --> 00:01:20.467
[ Laughter and applause ]

00:01:20.467 --> 00:01:22.100
[ As Giuliani ] "Why are you
waving your arms around?"

00:01:22.100 --> 00:01:23.567
[ Laughter ]

00:01:23.567 --> 00:01:25.934
Former Vice President Mike Pence
said in a new interview,

00:01:25.934 --> 00:01:28.200
that he's open to running
for president in 2024.

00:01:28.200 --> 00:01:31.767
I mean, so many people at the
Capitol were telling him to.

00:01:31.767 --> 00:01:33.334
"You better run, Mike Pence!

00:01:33.334 --> 00:01:36.033
You better run!"

00:01:36.033 --> 00:01:39.033
Krispy Kreme will give out
free doughnuts this week

00:01:39.033 --> 00:01:41.067
to any high school
or college senior

00:01:41.067 --> 00:01:44.234
that visits a store
wearing Class of 2022 apparel.

00:01:44.234 --> 00:01:46.868
And Dunkin' said
they'd give a free doughnut

00:01:46.868 --> 00:01:49.234
to anyone who comes in
wearing a shirt.

00:01:49.234 --> 00:01:52.601
[ Laughter ]
Any shirt.

00:01:52.601 --> 00:01:54.667
The luxury automaker
Mercedes-Benz

00:01:54.667 --> 00:01:56.234
announced last week
that it has sold

00:01:56.234 --> 00:01:58.667
the world's most expensive car
to a private owner

00:01:58.667 --> 00:02:00.467
for $142 million.

00:02:00.467 --> 00:02:03.701
Apparently, it cost that much
because the tank is full.

00:02:03.701 --> 00:02:06.634
[ Laughter ]

00:02:09.234 --> 00:02:11.167
And, finally,
a man in Wisconsin last week

00:02:11.167 --> 00:02:12.901
celebrated his 50th anniversary

00:02:12.901 --> 00:02:15.501
of eating a McDonald's Big Mac
almost daily

00:02:15.501 --> 00:02:16.767
and has only missed eight days.

00:02:16.767 --> 00:02:18.133
That's not bad.

00:02:18.133 --> 00:02:22.601
Fifty years of Big Macs
and only eight heart attacks.

00:02:23.067 --> 00:02:25.100
President Biden said
yesterday that

00:02:25.100 --> 00:02:28.367
the U.S. economic recovery
is going to take some time.

00:02:28.367 --> 00:02:30.067
Okay, "take some time" like

00:02:30.067 --> 00:02:32.667
the Amazon option that
saves you a dollar,

00:02:32.667 --> 00:02:35.434
or "take some time"
like "Avatar 2"?

00:02:35.434 --> 00:02:39.534
If he were any more vague,
he'd be a Magic 8 ball.

00:02:39.534 --> 00:02:40.868
[ Laughter ]

00:02:40.868 --> 00:02:43.367
President Biden said for
the third time yesterday

00:02:43.367 --> 00:02:45.601
that the U.S.
would respond militarily

00:02:45.601 --> 00:02:47.400
if China tries to invade Taiwan.

00:02:47.400 --> 00:02:50.200
Well, at least he's capable
of taking a firm stand

00:02:50.200 --> 00:02:51.901
on problems we don't have yet.

00:02:51.901 --> 00:02:54.467
"Yeah, yeah, we'll fight China!

00:02:54.467 --> 00:02:55.534
Student loans?

00:02:55.534 --> 00:02:58.667
Uh, yeah, let me call
some people."

00:02:58.667 --> 00:03:01.400
In her new memoir, ex-Trump
adviser Kellyanne Conway

00:03:01.400 --> 00:03:03.434
acknowledges that former
President Trump

00:03:03.434 --> 00:03:05.000
lost the 2020 election.

00:03:05.000 --> 00:03:07.167
I know. I was surprised, too.

00:03:07.167 --> 00:03:10.467
However, she does say he lost
to William Howard Taft.

00:03:10.467 --> 00:03:14.968
She just can't -- can't help
but get one lie in there.

00:03:14.968 --> 00:03:17.901
According to a new report,
ex-Trump attorney Michael Cohen

00:03:17.901 --> 00:03:20.934
said in a recent deposition that
former President Trump was

00:03:20.934 --> 00:03:26.567
afraid of getting pied in
the face by demonstrators.

00:03:26.567 --> 00:03:29.434
I don't know. That feels
like some reverse psychology.

00:03:29.434 --> 00:03:30.567
[ Imitating Donald Trump ]
"You know what?

00:03:30.567 --> 00:03:32.133
You know what would
totally own me?

00:03:32.133 --> 00:03:34.400
If someone threw an entire,

00:03:34.400 --> 00:03:37.100
freshly baked pie
right in my face.

00:03:37.100 --> 00:03:39.567
Even worse, if it had some
of that cinnamon crumble

00:03:39.567 --> 00:03:40.901
stuff on top of it.

00:03:40.901 --> 00:03:43.267
If they also hit me
with a side of whipped cream,

00:03:43.267 --> 00:03:45.467
oh, I would be so delicious --

00:03:45.467 --> 00:03:48.667
I mean, embarrassed."

00:03:48.667 --> 00:03:50.834
[ Normal voice ] A guitar played
by the late Kurt Cobain

00:03:50.834 --> 00:03:54.300
sold in an auction over the
weekend for nearly $5 million.

00:03:54.300 --> 00:03:56.067
It's the perfect way to say,

00:03:56.067 --> 00:03:58.601
"I don't get what he was
singing about."

00:03:58.601 --> 00:04:01.033
[ Light laughter ]

00:04:02.467 --> 00:04:05.767
That's working at home
with some stepdads right now.

00:04:05.767 --> 00:04:09.267
That joke's landing with some
stepdads right now at home,

00:04:09.267 --> 00:04:10.968
and I'm willing to suffer
through this moment

00:04:10.968 --> 00:04:13.100
with you guys.

00:04:13.100 --> 00:04:15.434
But I see you.

00:04:15.434 --> 00:04:17.767
[ Whispering ] Stepdads.

00:04:17.767 --> 00:04:20.167
Stepdads, I see you.

00:04:20.167 --> 00:04:22.934
Sorry about everybody here.
They're doing their own thing.

00:04:25.701 --> 00:04:28.300
[ Laughter ]

00:04:28.300 --> 00:04:30.767
[ Normal voice ] The fast food
chain Arby's announced yesterday

00:04:30.767 --> 00:04:32.767
that it will add
a hamburger to its menu

00:04:32.767 --> 00:04:34.200
for the first time
in its history,

00:04:34.200 --> 00:04:36.968
but people don't go to Arby's
because they want a burger.

00:04:36.968 --> 00:04:39.534
They go there because everything
else is closed.

00:04:39.534 --> 00:04:42.501
[ Laughter ]

00:04:42.501 --> 00:04:44.901
Bruce Springsteen
&amp; The E Street Band announced

00:04:44.901 --> 00:04:46.634
today that they'll go on
tour next year

00:04:46.634 --> 00:04:48.200
after a six-year hiatus.

00:04:48.200 --> 00:04:50.934
Though, just to be safe, they're
gonna put a sneeze guard

00:04:50.934 --> 00:04:52.367
between Bruce and Stevie.

00:04:52.367 --> 00:04:54.667
[ Light laughter ]

00:04:54.667 --> 00:04:55.801
[Whispering ] Step-dads.

00:04:55.801 --> 00:04:58.334
[ Laughter ]

00:04:58.334 --> 00:05:01.534
I don't know why I tried to do
two for you in the same show.

00:05:06.534 --> 00:05:08.868
[ Normal voice ] Firefighters in
New Jersey recently removed

00:05:08.868 --> 00:05:11.400
a four-foot monitor lizard
from a tree

00:05:11.400 --> 00:05:12.667
in a residential neighborhood.

00:05:12.667 --> 00:05:14.100
Isn't that wild?

00:05:14.100 --> 00:05:16.234
There's a tree in New Jersey.

00:05:16.234 --> 00:05:19.300
[ Laughter ]

00:05:19.300 --> 00:05:22.367
Don't shake your head, Wally.

00:05:22.367 --> 00:05:25.834
Our cue card, New Jersey's Wally
over on cue cards is like,

00:05:25.834 --> 00:05:27.267
"Ohh, trees."

00:05:27.267 --> 00:05:29.601
[ Laughter ]

00:05:34.067 --> 00:05:36.267
It's just very distracting
to read cue cards when you're

00:05:36.267 --> 00:05:37.567
scoffing at the punchline.

00:05:37.567 --> 00:05:39.367
-I have two trees in my yard.
-What did you say?

00:05:39.367 --> 00:05:40.634
-I have two trees
in my own yard.

00:05:40.634 --> 00:05:43.167
-Two trees? Well!

00:05:43.167 --> 00:05:45.100
Ol' two-tree Wally.

00:05:45.100 --> 00:05:47.167
[ Laughter ]

00:05:50.133 --> 00:05:52.501
Are you gonna go to Wally's
two-tree summer party?

00:05:52.501 --> 00:05:54.701
[ Laughter ]

00:05:56.234 --> 00:05:59.033
And finally, New York City
yesterday removed its last

00:05:59.033 --> 00:06:00.667
public payphone from service.

00:06:00.667 --> 00:06:02.934
But don't worry,
anywhere else in New York

00:06:02.934 --> 00:06:05.834
will still be a public restroom.

00:06:05.834 --> 00:06:08.601
President Biden spoke from
the White House on Tuesday

00:06:08.601 --> 00:06:11.033
and asked when the country
will be ready to

00:06:11.033 --> 00:06:12.601
stand up to the gun lobby.

00:06:12.601 --> 00:06:14.000
When we will?

00:06:14.000 --> 00:06:15.534
That's like your landlord
saying,

00:06:15.534 --> 00:06:18.367
"Ooh, you got to do
something about these mice."

00:06:18.367 --> 00:06:19.868
[ Laughter ]

00:06:19.868 --> 00:06:21.567
The White House announced --
has announced

00:06:21.567 --> 00:06:23.701
that the K-Pop group BTS

00:06:23.701 --> 00:06:25.667
will appear next week
with President Biden,

00:06:25.667 --> 00:06:28.267
because the White House
is always looking for ways

00:06:28.267 --> 00:06:30.434
to make Biden look even older.

00:06:30.434 --> 00:06:31.501
[ Laughter ]

00:06:31.501 --> 00:06:32.701
I mean, look at that.

00:06:32.701 --> 00:06:35.834
That's like a Korean
remake of "Scooby Doo."

00:06:35.834 --> 00:06:37.133
[ Laughter ]

00:06:37.133 --> 00:06:38.901
"I would have gotten away with
it if it weren't for

00:06:38.901 --> 00:06:42.367
these pesky kids
and their catchy hooks."

00:06:42.367 --> 00:06:43.601
[ Laughter ]

00:06:43.601 --> 00:06:46.200
Georgia Republican Senate
candidate Herschel Walker

00:06:46.200 --> 00:06:48.601
said in a new interview that
he's never heard

00:06:48.601 --> 00:06:51.467
former President Trump say
that the 2020 election

00:06:51.467 --> 00:06:52.767
was stolen from him.

00:06:52.767 --> 00:06:54.701
Even more troubling,
he also said,

00:06:54.701 --> 00:06:57.367
"Who is this Herschel Walker
I keep hearing about?"

00:06:57.367 --> 00:06:59.133
That's right,

00:06:59.133 --> 00:07:01.300
Herschel Walker said that
he's never heard Trump say

00:07:01.300 --> 00:07:02.934
that the 2020 election
was stolen,

00:07:02.934 --> 00:07:04.968
which is kind of like saying
you've never heard

00:07:04.968 --> 00:07:06.834
Flo talk about Progressive.

00:07:06.834 --> 00:07:10.934
I've never heard her talk about
anything else!

00:07:10.934 --> 00:07:12.534
Representative
Marjorie Taylor Greene

00:07:12.534 --> 00:07:14.667
won this week's
Republican primary

00:07:14.667 --> 00:07:16.901
in Georgia's
14th Congressional district.

00:07:16.901 --> 00:07:19.968
But just for fun, she's going
to storm the Capitol anyway.

00:07:19.968 --> 00:07:21.234
[ Laughter ]

00:07:21.234 --> 00:07:24.634
It's a celebration storm!

00:07:24.634 --> 00:07:26.467
MSNBC announced this week

00:07:26.467 --> 00:07:29.000
that former White House
Press Secretary Jen Psaki

00:07:29.000 --> 00:07:30.634
will host a new streaming show.

00:07:30.634 --> 00:07:32.834
Well, let's hope
"White House to NBC"

00:07:32.834 --> 00:07:35.033
goes better than
"NBC to the White House."

00:07:35.033 --> 00:07:37.634
[ Laughter ]

00:07:37.634 --> 00:07:39.501
[ Chuckles ]

00:07:39.501 --> 00:07:42.334
A romance novelist --
alright.

00:07:42.334 --> 00:07:44.100
No one rememb--

00:07:44.100 --> 00:07:45.434
I don't remember
what show that was.

00:07:45.434 --> 00:07:46.701
It could've been on
any network.

00:07:46.701 --> 00:07:48.400
[ Laughter ]

00:07:48.400 --> 00:07:52.133
A romance novelist in Oregon
who wrote a book -- excuse me.

00:07:52.133 --> 00:07:55.667
A romance novelist in Oregon
who wrote a blog post titled

00:07:55.667 --> 00:07:58.067
"How to Murder Your Husband"
was convicted yesterday

00:07:58.067 --> 00:07:59.133
of killing her husband.

00:07:59.133 --> 00:08:00.634
[ Laughter ]

00:08:00.634 --> 00:08:03.400
In case you're wondering how far
you have to go to get someone

00:08:03.400 --> 00:08:05.400
to read a blog post.

00:08:05.400 --> 00:08:08.367
[ Laughter ]

00:08:08.367 --> 00:08:10.968
According to a new survey,
41% of Americans

00:08:10.968 --> 00:08:13.434
said that their largest
single monthly expense

00:08:13.434 --> 00:08:17.267
is rent or mortgage,
and one said dinosaur skulls.

00:08:17.267 --> 00:08:20.667
[ Laughter ]

00:08:20.667 --> 00:08:22.934
Amtrak this week released
pictures of its new

00:08:22.934 --> 00:08:26.234
Acela trains, which will feature
contactless restrooms.

00:08:26.234 --> 00:08:28.834
Well, contactless
depending on your balance.

00:08:28.834 --> 00:08:34.634
[ Laughter ]

00:08:34.634 --> 00:08:35.801
Walking down one of those
is like

00:08:35.801 --> 00:08:38.868
walking down an old rope bridge.

00:08:38.868 --> 00:08:40.901
And finally, a plaster cast

00:08:40.901 --> 00:08:43.367
of the late singer
Jimi Hendrix's penis

00:08:43.367 --> 00:08:44.968
is set to be unveiled next month

00:08:44.968 --> 00:08:47.434
at the Phallological Museum
in Iceland,

00:08:47.434 --> 00:08:50.501
which houses the world's largest
display of penises.

00:08:50.501 --> 00:08:52.767
It costs adults
10 bucks to enter,

00:08:52.767 --> 00:08:54.267
while members get in free.

00:08:54.267 --> 00:08:57.667
[ Laughter ]

00:09:01.067 --> 00:09:02.601
He wrote --
he writes in my voice.

00:09:02.601 --> 00:09:04.834
That's what I like about him.

00:09:04.834 --> 00:09:06.300
You guys,
that was the monologue.

00:09:06.300 --> 00:09:11.634
♪♪

